 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, July to August came in at 74% and August to September at 72%. So far in 2026 on the middle of the grids, March to April came in at 188% and May to June at 79%. Grid 26875 had its driest year in 1956 at 68%.</p>"}
